    {
      "id": "q1",
      "step": "01",
      "statement": "اكتب المجموع A على الشكل $a\\sqrt{5}$ (مع $a$ عدد طبيعي) حيث: $A = \\sqrt{125} + \\sqrt{45} - \\sqrt{20}$",
      "learningPoints": [
        {
          "code": "4am_tawzif-khawass-judhur_P2",
          "role": "primary"
        },
        {
          "code": "4am_tawzif-khawass-judhur_P1",
          "role": "secondary"
        }
      ],
      "cognitiveDemand": "apply",
      "answerType": "rational",
      "answerFormat": "اكتب العدد $a$ فقط (عدد طبيعي)",
      "expectedAnswer": "6",
      "misconceptionSignatures": [
        {
          "value": "10",
          "id": "MISC-ISHARA"
        }
      ],
      "hints": [
        {
          "id": "h1",
          "type": "look",
          "content": "اكتب كل جذر على الشكل $x\\sqrt{5}$: ابحث عن أكبر مربع تامّ يقسم العدد الذي تحت الجذر."
        },
        {
          "id": "h2",
          "type": "direction",
          "content": "استعمل $\\sqrt{m \\times 5} = \\sqrt{m} \\times \\sqrt{5}$ ثم احسب جذر المربع التامّ."
        },
        {
          "id": "h3",
          "type": "strategy",
          "content": "اجمع المعاملات بإشاراتها بالخاصية التوزيعية: $x\\sqrt{5} + y\\sqrt{5} = (x + y)\\sqrt{5}$."
        }
      ],
      "feedback": {
        "correct": "$A = 5\\sqrt{5} + 3\\sqrt{5} - 2\\sqrt{5} = 6\\sqrt{5}$.",
        "incorrect": "اكتب كل جذر على الشكل $x\\sqrt{5}$، ثم اجمع المعاملات بإشاراتها."
      },
      "solution": {
        "lines": [
          "$A = \\sqrt{125} + \\sqrt{45} - \\sqrt{20}$",
          "$A = \\sqrt{25} \\times \\sqrt{5} + \\sqrt{9} \\times \\sqrt{5} - \\sqrt{4} \\times \\sqrt{5}$",
          "$A = 5\\sqrt{5} + 3\\sqrt{5} - 2\\sqrt{5}$",
          "$A = (5 + 3 - 2)\\sqrt{5}$"
        ],
        "result": "A = 6\\sqrt{5}"
      },
      "work": "optional",
      "timeSeconds": 240
    },
    {
      "id": "q2",
      "step": "02",
      "statement": "احسب الجداء $A \\times \\dfrac{\\sqrt{5}}{30}$ مبينا مراحل الحساب.",
      "learningPoints": [
        {
          "code": "4am_tawzif-khawass-judhur_P2",
          "role": "primary"
        }
      ],
      "cognitiveDemand": "apply",
      "answerType": "rational",
      "answerFormat": "اكتب قيمة الجداء (عدد طبيعي)",
      "expectedAnswer": "1",
      "misconceptionSignatures": [
        {
          "value": "5",
          "id": "MISC-JIDHR-FI-JIDHR"
        }
      ],
      "hints": [
        {
          "id": "h1",
          "type": "look",
          "content": "عوّض A بالكتابة التي وجدتها في السؤال 01."
        },
        {
          "id": "h2",
          "type": "direction",
          "content": "$\\sqrt{5} \\times \\sqrt{5} = 5$"
        },
        {
          "id": "h3",
          "type": "strategy",
          "content": "اختزل الكسر الناتج."
        }
      ],
      "feedback": {
        "correct": "$A \\times \\dfrac{\\sqrt{5}}{30} = \\dfrac{6 \\times 5}{30} = 1$.",
        "incorrect": "عوّض A بالكتابة $a\\sqrt{5}$، واحسب $\\sqrt{5} \\times \\sqrt{5}$ ثم اختزل."
      },
      "solution": {
        "lines": [
          "$A \\times \\dfrac{\\sqrt{5}}{30} = 6\\sqrt{5} \\times \\dfrac{\\sqrt{5}}{30}$",
          "$= \\dfrac{6 \\times \\sqrt{5} \\times \\sqrt{5}}{30}$",
          "$= \\dfrac{6 \\times 5}{30} = \\dfrac{30}{30}$",
          "$= 1$"
        ],
        "result": "A \\times \\dfrac{\\sqrt{5}}{30} = 1"
      },
      "work": "required",
      "timeSeconds": 180
    }
